<title>USA: AMBAC qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>AMBAC qualifies seven muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMBAC Indemnity Corp said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Los Angeles, Calif., $87.5 million certificates of participation.  </p>
<p>--Hopkins, Minn., $2.24 million general obligation bonds.</p>
<p>--St Louis County, Minn., $5.275 million bonds.</p>
<p>--Clarkstown, N.Y., $4.5 million land acquisition bonds.</p>
<p>--Johnson City, Tenn., $10 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Wilson County, Tenn., $5.8 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Hurst Community Services Development, Texas, $2.3 million sales tax revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
